{
  "_about": "Legion types, one entry each (lane A4 builds the AI, lane B2 the models). \"behaviour\" names the AI script in scripts/ai/; \"perception\" drives sight and hearing; \"weak_points\" are named parts in the model export. Figures are lane A1 drafts. Lane A4: mass is never typed here, it is summed from the export's parts (B2: Ameise 10 t, Grauwolf 10 t, Löwe 50 t). \"gait\" tunes LegionMech (step_m: the longest a foot travels under the body in one stance; lift; duty walking and duty_run from run_m_s; the cadence cap; max_slope_deg and step_up: the footholds a leg will take; leg_max_load: one leg's load limit in body weights; spring bounce, grip, drive and turn time, aim joint rate and limits); \"ai\" tunes the brain (scripts/ai/legion_brain.gd and the behaviour: think rate, speeds, ranges, hearing, fire cones and bursts, flank angles, muzzle sockets per weapon); \"damage\" splits health into zones (hull, legs, arms, weak points) with their armour, and to_hull passes a share of a penetrating weak-point hit on to the hull. The Löwe's 240 mm hull is past the 57 mm APFSDS (180 mm): flank it for the turret ring and rear deck.",
